@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor LightBlue

title Transferência de Propriedade - Parte 1: Solicitação

actor "Vendedor" as Seller
actor "Comprador" as Buyer
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "BFF Gateway" as BFF
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Queue Worker" as QW
participant "Offchain\nConsumer" as OC
participant "Blockchain\n(Besu)" as BC
participant "Event\nListener" as EL

Buyer -> FE: Seleciona propriedade para comprar\n(matriculaId: 12345)
activate FE

FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/request\n{\n  matriculaId: 12345,\n  buyerCpf: "12345678901"\n}
activate BFF

BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/request\n+ JWT (authenticated as buyer)
activate Orch

Orch -> Orch: Extract userId from JWT

Orch -> DB: SELECT * FROM properties\nWHERE matricula_id = 12345
activate DB
DB --> Orch: {id, proprietario (sellerId), status: OK, ...}
deactivate DB

Orch -> Orch: Validate:\n- Property exists\n- Status == OK\n- Buyer != Seller

Orch -> DB: SELECT * FROM transfers\nWHERE matricula_id = 12345\n  AND status NOT IN ('CONCLUIDA')
activate DB
DB --> Orch: No active transfer
deactivate DB

Orch -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE cpf = "12345678901"
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Buyer {id, walletAddress: 0x1f5c...}
deactivate DB

Orch -> DB: INSERT INTO transfers\n(\n  matricula_id,\n  seller_id,\n  buyer_id,\n  status\n) VALUES (12345, sellerId, buyerId, 'PENDENTE')
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Transfer ID created
deactivate DB

Orch -> MQ: Publish CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job\n{\n  transferId,\n  sellerAddress: 0x3b59...,\n  buyerAddress: 0x1f5c...,\n  matricula: 12345\n}
activate MQ
deactivate MQ

Orch -> DB: UPDATE transfers\nSET status = 'CONFIGURANDO'\nWHERE id = transferId
activate DB
deactivate DB

Orch --> BFF: 201 Created\n{transferId, status: "CONFIGURANDO"}
deactivate Orch

BFF --> FE: Transfer initiated
deactivate BFF

FE --> Buyer: "Transferência em processamento.\nAguardando configuração na blockchain..."
deactivate FE

== Processamento Assíncrono ==

MQ --> QW: Consume CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job
activate QW

QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/request\n{\n  from: "0x3b59...",\n  to: "0x1f5c...",\n  matricula: 12345\n}
activate OC

OC -> OC: Build transaction:\nrequestPropertyTransfer(\n  from,\n  to,\n  matricula\n)

OC -> BC: Submit transaction to Besu
activate BC

BC --> OC: Transaction Hash: 0xdef456...
OC --> QW: {requestHash, txHash}
deactivate QW

BC -> BC: Mine transaction

BC -> BC: Validate:\n- propertyExists[matricula]\n- propertyOwner[matricula] == from\n- identityRegistry.isVerified(to)

BC -> BC: Calculate requestHash:\nkeccak256(from, to, matricula)

BC -> BC: Store in pendingTransfers[requestHash]:\n{\n  matricula,\n  from,\n  to,\n  requester,\n  requestedAt,\n  exists: true,\n  financialApproved: false,\n  registryOfficeApproved: false,\n  municipalityApproved: false,\n  buyerAccepted: false,\n  executed: false\n}

BC -> BC: **Emit TransferRequested**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  matricula,\n  from,\n  to,\n  requester\n}

BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL

EL -> EL: Parse event:\n- event.args[0] = requestHash\n- event.args[1] = matricula\n- event.args[2] = from\n- event.args[3] = to\n- event.transactionHash

EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-requested\n{\n  transferHash: requestHash,\n  matriculaId: 12345,\n  from: "0x3b59...",\n  to: "0x1f5c...",\n  transactionHash: "0xdef456..."\n}
activate Orch

Orch -> DB: UPDATE transfers\nSET request_hash = ?,\n    blockchain_tx_hash = ?,\n    status = 'AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES'\nWHERE matricula_id = 12345
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Updated
deactivate DB

Orch --> EL: 200 OK
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL

note over Buyer, BC
**STATUS ATUAL:**
- Transferência: AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES
- request_hash: preenchido
- blockchain_tx_hash: preenchido
- Aguardando 3 aprovações + aceitação do comprador (parte 2)
end note

@enduml
